<title>JAPAN: Nohmi Bosai - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nohmi Bosai - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 28.08		vs	   27.63</p>
<p> Operating	  405    million    vs	  103    million</p>
<p> Current	    507    million    vs	  534    million</p>
<p> Net		  234    million    vs	  253    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.54 yen	  vs	    5.98 yen</p>
